From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] Split VEUX read-only TLMM probe and normal boot display

The held variant compares the Blair DT window and REG_BASE-adjusted window
without changing pins, rails, reset, or storage. Normal boot has no diagnostic
console; it gets a temporary corner label until the first GUI present. Remove
the pmap no-fault translation experiment from touch startup.
